#29000
"South of a Great Winter Plain"
"At the top of this rise, you finally have a view of what lies far to the

north: the great frozen wall of legend.  Even with the towering mountains

visible in all directions, and the yawning spaces of the chasms on the edges

of the ridge to the east and west, the frozen wall dominates the landscape at

the northern end of this flat plateau stretching before you.  Snow swirls as

it is blown from the plateau edges down into a torrential blizzard far south

of here.  The ridge continues down a slope to the south, where some recent

battle appears to have stirred the snow about.

"
"[Nereus] Room Finished.

"
