E
"frozen wall legend"
"Legends of the Dragonspires tell of a marvelous frozen wall, miles tall and

long.  Now it is evident that the legends were at least partially true.  The

plateau stretches north for miles, flat and blindingly white; at the end the

wall waits, beckoning you to get a closer view.

"
