#29002
"Dragonspire Plateau - Southern Edge"
"Swirling, hypnotic snow swirls downward, swallowed by the yawning chasm just

south of the edge of this inhospitable plateau.  Tracks are common here; bear,

wolf, fox, rabbit, and possibly others that have since dusted over.  The snow

is covered in a thin layer of ice and is untouched along the lip of the chasm;

the animals seem to know to avoid the danger of the edge.  The panorama of the

Dragonspires stretches from east to west south of the plateau, snow-capped

peaks visible for as far as the eye can see.  Far to the southwest, along the

mountain ridge leading to the plateau, a blizzard rages, possibly caused by

the wind swirling down from the plateau itself.

"
"[Nereus] ** Room Finished **

"
