#29004
"Snowy Hill - Edge of the Plateau"
"From the southeastern edge of this plateau, you can see for miles off to the

south and east as, below you, a cliff edge drops down into white nothingness

and the splendor of the Dragonspires stretches southward forever.  The snow

here, while deep, is frozen over with a thick crust of ice, making movement

fairly easy.  Tracks of a rabbit, a fox, and another much larger predator are

evident throughout this plateau edge, evidence of wildlife.  A steep hillside

rises to the north, a small hole visible at its base, while the plateau

continues to stretch off to the west.

"
"[Nereus] Action here for fox to pick up the corpse and go north into its den

[Nereus] Room Finished.

"
