#29005
"A Cozy Den"
"This hole in the snowy hillside is not very large, and could perhaps

accommodate a few dogs comfortably.  It is apparently now used as the den of

some small creature in this northern wasteland -- it smells of damp fur and

faintly of urine and blood.  A litter of small bones and shed fur covers the

dirt floor of this cavern, making the ground cluttered but quite soft.  A

small hole winds out to the outdoors to the south, its curve blocking the wind

from blowing into the den.

"
"[Nereus] Room Finished

"
