#29006
"Near the Southern End of a Great Wintry Plain"
"Like a slithering snake, a chasm winds its way from north to west just to the

southwest of here, marking the southwestern edge of this arctic plateau.  The

snow here is waist-deep, soft and powdery to the touch, and drifts in softly

from the east and above.  Much less disturbed than the snow further south and

the the east, the deeper snow has evident tracks and seems a bit less

powdery.  In the distance to the south, the Dragonspires tower against the

horizon, bleak reminders of how far you have travelled to reach this northern

wasteland.

"
"[Nereus] ** Room Finished **

"
