#29008
"Collapsing Trail - Narrow Segment"
"The trail narrows to a handspan here, topped with crumbling stone and sheets

of impossibly slick ice.  Far away in the south, the Dragonspires stretch for

miles, uncaring and impressive.  The collapse of this region appears to be

spreading from an enormous sinkhole to the north; between the chasm awaiting

you to the south and the tons of ice and rock that lay in the pit to the

north, this is not the best place to remain safely.  An even more narrow

stretch awaits to the west, where a thin spire of rock rises dozens of feet

overhead.

"
"[Nereus] fall to 82015 on the dragonspire trail below

[Nereus] no.mount

[Nereus] ** Room Finished **

