#29009
"Standing Above the Emptiness"
"From this perch atop a narrow peak, one can get an appreciation for the

vastness and implacability of nature.  For hundreds of miles to the south and

west, the snow-capped peaks of the Dragonspires spread out below you. 

Northeast of here, a plain of snow and rock has collapsed over the ages,

leaving a gaping scar in the landscape.  At your feet, the snow has collected

here on this rise, long since crusted over with a thin coating of ice. 

Traversing the collapsing trails to the east and north would be a dangerous

balancing act; a single error could send you tumbling into nothingness below.

"
"[Nereus] No.Mount

"
