#29010
"Atop a Collapsing Ridge - Treacherous Footing"
"A handspan of narrow, crumbling grey rock lines the ridge's peak here; a

single slip could send a traveller off the steep cliff edge to the west or the

yawning, rubble-lined sinkhole to the east.  A thin coating of ice has

collected here on the grey rock, making travel extremely hazardous.  A narrow

spire of rock, covered in a thin dusting of snow, lies at the top of a ridge

to the south.  Unfortunately, the top of the ridge appears to be near collapse

in that direction; perhaps it would be better to turn back.

"
"[Nereus] fall from here to 82015 on the dragonspire trail below

