#29011
"Narrow Ridgeline Between Two Chasms"
"The protective cliff face to the north falls away to nothingness, leaving this

narrow ridge exposed to the scouring winds and dizzying depths to the north

and west.  At your feet, the grey, crumbly rock of the plateau is exposed,

blasted clean by the wind.  Far to the south, further up a rocky rise, a peak

looms above the area.  The might of the Dragonspires continues for miles to

the west, while a view of the legendary frozen wall is blocked by a nearby

peak to the northeast.

"
