#29043
"Dragonspire Plateau"
"The snow here is nearly as deep as a man is tall at this crossroads of animal

activity in the center of the plateau.  The tracks of an enormous bear,

wolves, and something even larger with rounder, flatter feet are evident

moving in all directions except north, trampling the snow into ice.  East of

here, a tree made of purest ice stands tall over the snow of the plain, while

to the north, an archway is visible, carved into the face of the frozen wall

