"Waist-deep snow covers the icy ground here, disturbed by the deep tracks of a

number of large predators.  A rough cliffside rises thirty feet above the edge

of the plain here, eroded strangely and composed of extremely rough, grey

stone.  To the west, a large tree rises above the snow, while the frozen wall

runs the length of the plateau just north of here.

"
"[Nereus] ** Room Finished **

