#29046
"Cliff Ledge Overlooking the Dragonspire Plateau"
"Huddled on this narrow rock ledge on a cliff face, the wind whips and blusters

past the cliff face, carrying tiny particles of ice and biting snow with it. 

Blindingly white and magnificently flat, the surface of the Dragonspire

plateau stretches out westward for miles, framed by mountains far in the

distance to the west, and the humbling frozen wall to the north.  A narrow,

ice-rimed fissure is visible in the cliffside to the east, possibly offering

some shelter from the biting cold.  The cliff face below, while slick with

ice, is cracked and rough and could probably be climbed down fairly easily.

"
"[Nereus] Room Finished.

Just a thought, they can see the lake, can they see the waterfall?  Perhaps

not.  -Talis

"
